# repo shared with the other apps — same setup as pawsekeys and fincampx.
#
# CI reads it with a deploy key (MATCH_GIT_PRIVATE_KEY) and never writes:
# every CI lane passes readonly: true. To mint or renew the Developer ID
# profile, run `bundle exec fastlane sync_signing` locally, where you have
# write access (see the lane's comment in the Fastfile).
